bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_inline_item_layoutunit_ceil_pen_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 1x-lcd lane: Chrome getBoundingClientRect of the <code> items measured (57.796875 / 48.171875 / 9.640625); engine origins -26 / 21 / -47 steps of 1/128 px against Chrome's -26 / 22 / -46. Needs a layout owner (layout_foundation)."
